    <section style="padding: 80px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(111,185,240,0.10);">
      <div style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: #4E7EA6; margin-bottom: 12px;">08 · WARNA</div>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 32px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; color: #8FAAC2; max-width: 730px; text-wrap: pretty;"><strong style="color:#C9DFF2;font-weight:600;">Satu hue merek, sisanya nada.</strong> Seluruh roda warna disisir untuk mencari hue kedua dan ketiga; kandidat terbaik hanya mencapai ΔE 13,2 — di bawah ambang aman 15. Enam warna status Telegram sudah memenuhi ruang warna, jadi hue baru apa pun pasti bertabrakan. Sistem lengkap ada di <strong style="color:#C9DFF2;font-weight:600;">Caraka Sistem Warna</strong>.</p>

      <div style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #4E7EA6; margin-bottom: 14px;">PRIMARY — KESUMBA · OKLCH H=31,8°</div>
      <div class="ck-m-ramp" style="display: flex; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 14px;">
        {ramp.map((r) => (
          <div style="flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <div style={`height: 84px; background: ${r.hex}; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; padding-bottom: 8px;`}><span style={`font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; color: ${r.ink};`}>{r.step}</span></div>
            <div style="padding: 9px 4px; background: #080B10; text-align: center; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 8.5px; color: #4E7EA6;">{r.hex}</div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 34px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #8FAAC2; text-wrap: pretty;"><strong style="color:#FF7A5E;font-weight:600;">500 untuk lambang dan tombol; 400 untuk teks.</strong> Kesumba 500 hanya mencapai 4,89:1 di atas void — cukup untuk elemen besar, tidak untuk teks kecil. Kesumba 400 mencapai 7,83:1.</p>

      <div style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #4E7EA6; margin-bottom: 14px;">SEMANTIK — TERKUNCI PADA IKON TOPIC TELEGRAM</div>
      <div class="ck-m-sem" style="display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        {semantic.map((s) => (
          <div style="flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
            <div style={`height: 104px; border-radius: 12px; background: ${s.hex}; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 26px; color: #07090D;`}>{s.glyph}</div>
            <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px;"><span style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #F2F8FF;">{s.role}</span><span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #6E93B2;">{s.hex}</span><span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; color: #4E7EA6;">{s.dec}</span></div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 17px 20px; background: rgba(226,69,44,0.07); border-left: 2px solid #E2452C; margin-bottom: 34px;">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.65; color: #E0B4A8; text-wrap: pretty;">Merah Telegram <code style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;">#FB6F5F</code> <strong style="color:#FF8B6B;font-weight:600;">dikosongkan</strong> — jaraknya ke kesumba hanya ΔE 9,9. Dan karena himpunan ini gagal uji buta warna — <code style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;">done</code> ↔ <code style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;">cancelled</code> berjarak ΔE 2,5 pada deuteranopia — <strong style="color:#FF8B6B;font-weight:600;">setiap status wajib membawa glifnya</strong>. Warna tidak pernah menjadi satu-satunya sinyal.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; color: #4E7EA6; margin-bottom: 14px;">SECONDARY — NETRAL DINGIN · H=250°</div>
      <div class="ck-m-ramp" style="display: flex; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;">
        {neutrals.map((n) => (
          <div style="flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <div style={`height: 76px; background: ${n.hex}; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; padding-bottom: 8px;`}><span style={`font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; color: ${n.ink};`}>{n.step}</span></div>
            <div style="padding: 9px 3px; background: #080B10; text-align: center; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 8px; color: #4E7EA6;">{n.hex}</div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p style="margin: 14px 0 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #8FAAC2; text-wrap: pretty;">Membawa 90% permukaan. Chroma 0,005–0,020 — cukup untuk terasa dingin dan teknis, terlalu rendah untuk bersaing dengan kesumba. <strong style="color:#C9DFF2;font-weight:600;">Tertiary</strong> bukan hue ketiga, melainkan kesumba pada chroma sangat rendah: <code style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;">#12100F</code> · <code style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;">#1E1614</code> · <code style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;">#2B1612</code>.</p>
    </section>

