              <div aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; right: 12px; top: 12px; width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(226,69,44,0.16); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; color: #E2452C;">✗</div>
